sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor U as User/App
    participant API as Bot Detection API
    participant IN as Signal Ingestion
    participant FS as Feature Service
    participant RE as Online Risk Engine
    participant PE as Policy Engine
    participant AX as Action Executor
    participant DB as Risk/Action Database

    box rgb(240, 240, 240) Offline Training & Review
    participant IR as Investigator/Appeals
    participant ML as ML Training Pipeline
    participant EV as Evaluation & Approval Gate
    end

    %% Online Flow
    U->>API: Account Action (POST /api/v1/bot-detection/evaluate-account)
    API->>IN: Ingest Event
    IN->>FS: Update Aggregates
    API->>RE: Request Score
    RE->>FS: Fetch Features
    FS-->>RE: Return Features
    RE->>RE: Compute Score & Confidence (model_version)
    RE->>PE: Evaluate Policy

    alt Action Required (limit/challenge/demote/suspend)
        PE->>AX: Apply Graduated Action
        alt Action Application Success
            AX->>DB: Record ACTION_EVENT & ACCOUNT_RISK_STATE (versioned & rollback_ref)
            AX-->>PE: Enforcement Confirmed
            PE-->>API: Action Decision (Success)
            API-->>U: Return Remediation/Challenge Response
        else Action Application Failure
            AX-->>PE: Enforcement Failed
            PE-->>API: Action Decision (Failed)
            API-->>U: Return Degraded/Retry Response
        end
    else No Action
        PE->>DB: Update ACCOUNT_RISK_STATE
        PE-->>API: OK
        API-->>U: Return Success
    end

    %% Offline Labeling & Appeal Flow
    U->>API: Submit Appeal (POST /api/v1/bot-detection/appeals)
    API->>IR: Route to Appeal Queue
    IR->>API: Investigator Review & Label (POST /api/v1/bot-detection/investigator-labels)
    API->>DB: Validate & Persist INVESTIGATOR_LABEL

    %% Training & Deployment Gate Flow
    DB-->>ML: Extract Trusted Labels
    ML->>ML: Retrain Model & Calibrate
    ML->>EV: Submit Candidate Model
    EV->>EV: Validate Precision Floors & Drift

    alt Approved
        EV->>RE: Deploy Model (Controlled Rollout)
    else Rejected
        EV-->>ML: Reject Candidate
    end
